# Project Title: Turtle Race

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used to create a program which lets the user bet on which turtle will win a race

### Dependencies

Mandatory: 

KEY POINTS:
1. Turtle creates 7 different turtles
2. Start function puts all the turtles on the starting line
3. ready_set_go function starts the race
4. Bet is made AFTER the turtles have been made
5. if the user picks a color outside the list of colors, the program will give a notification and close.

### Installations Needed

turtle library
random library
tkinter library

